# Spec-driven development (VoiceIQ)

This project uses **specs as source of truth** in `docs/specs/`.

## Before implementing or changing behaviour

1. Read `docs/specs/README.md` and the relevant `docs/specs/features/F*.md`.
2. Scoring formulas: `docs/Call-and-Agent-Performance.md`.
3. Agent instructions: root `AGENTS.md`.

## When you change code that affects product behaviour

- Update the matching feature spec in the same change set.
- Check off or add acceptance criteria in that spec.
- Update spec **Status** (Draft → Implemented / Partial).

## Do not guess

- Connect/voicemail rules → F06, `backend/src/voicemail.ts`
- Disposition vs call outcome → F04 (separate fields)
- Quarter KPIs → F03 + scoring doc
- API contracts → `docs/specs/04-api-contract.md`

## New features

Copy `docs/specs/_template-feature.md`, assign next F-number, link from `docs/specs/README.md`.
